      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REGARDS SENT MAX (2) jumped from a middle draw last time and could manage only fifth and beaten 4.5 lengths (23.16) at this track. Has claims if he runs up to expectations. LIQUID DESIRE (5) has been in the money at his last two runs, most recently when third (23.04) in a Maiden over 400m at this track. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. RATTLE YOUR DAGS (1) boxed on the inside and gets chance to find form. Last time finished last in a Maiden on July 18 over 520m at Cannington behind Exile Fury beaten 14 lengths (31.22). Key runner who gets his chance to atone. GO GETTEM SASSY (7) makes debut for the Ben Abercrombie kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Can run a bold race on debut.",
